# Allow-list: the build context is ONLY what the Dockerfile copies.
# Everything else (env files, credentials, venvs, caches, data, tests) is excluded by default.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements/runtime.lock
!requirements/build.lock
!src/
!config/

# Re-exclude junk and anything secret-looking that could sit inside allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*
**/.aws
**/.DS_Store
